  "Format: vertical 9:16 (from mission and brand card)",
  "Language: English (US market per brand card)",
  "Market: US (explicit in brand card)",
  "Duration: 6-15s (mission says under 15s; research and platform norms support 6s minimum for effectiveness)",
  "Audio: Not specified; assumed optional (music, SFX, or voiceover allowed but not required for vision checks)"
